        domain Id ref
    domainIdSelector : SagemakerAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1UserProfileSpecInitProviderDomainIDSelector, default is Undefined, optional
        domain Id selector
    singleSignOnUserIdentifier : str, default is Undefined, optional
        A specifier for the type of value specified in single_sign_on_user_value. Currently, the only supported value is UserName. If the Domain's AuthMode is SSO, this field is required. If the Domain's AuthMode is not SSO, this field cannot be specified.
    singleSignOnUserValue : str, default is Undefined, optional
        The username of the associated AWS Single Sign-On User for this User Profile. If the Domain's AuthMode is SSO, this field is required, and must match a valid username of a user in your directory. If the Domain's AuthMode is not SSO, this field cannot be specified.
    tags : {str:str}, default is Undefined, optional
        Key-value map of resource tags.
    userProfileName : str, default is Undefined, optional
        The name for the User Profile.
    userSettings : SagemakerAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1UserProfileSpecInitProviderUserSettings, default is Undefined, optional
        user settings
    """


